      "content": "7. Collective Responsibility"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 75 specifically mandates that the Council of Ministers is collectively responsible to the Lok Sabha, not the Rajya Sabha.",
        "Article 78 details the constitutional duty of the Prime Minister to communicate all decisions of the Council of Ministers to the President.",
        "Questions frequently test the structural and functional differences between the larger Council of Ministers and the smaller Cabinet."
      ],
